{"parentUuid":"ce2c409d-875e-4eef-a81d-d78e67ebb813","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"64d71192-3b1b-4e70-aef9-d69f40568796","agentId":"a4ecd78d0488484e7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VgxyHH1R6Ms1YjdMgJdEry","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"OR-Tools 9.17 9.18 release notes 2026 CP-SAT\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"OR-Tools Release Notes | Google for Developers\",\"url\":\"https://developers.google.com/optimization/support/release_notes\"},{\"title\":\"Releases · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/releases\"},{\"title\":\"or-tools-discuss - Google Groups\",\"url\":\"https://groups.google.com/g/or-tools-discuss\"},{\"title\":\"CP-SAT Solver | OR-Tools | Google for Developers\",\"url\":\"https://developers.google.com/optimization/cp/cp_solver\"},{\"title\":\"Introduction - The CP-SAT Primer - Using and Understanding Google OR-Tools' CP-SAT Solver\",\"url\":\"https://d-krupke.github.io/cpsat-primer/\"},{\"title\":\"ortools.sat.python.cp_model API documentation\",\"url\":\"https://or-tools.github.io/docs/pdoc/ortools/sat/python/cp_model.html\"},{\"title\":\"OR-Tools - Wikipedia\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/OR-Tools\"},{\"title\":\"or-tools/ortools/sat/docs/README.md at stable · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/stable/ortools/sat/docs/README.md\"},{\"title\":\"Constraint Optimization | OR-Tools | Google for Developers\",\"url\":\"https://developers.google.com/optimization/cp/\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - d-krupke/cpsat-primer: The CP-SAT Primer: Using and Understanding Google OR-Tools' CP-SAT Solver · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/d-krupke/cpsat-primer\"}]\n\nBased on the web search results, I found some relevant information about OR-Tools releases:\n\nRecent OR-Tools releases include support for Rocky Linux 9 and Ubuntu 24.04 LTS. The search results include references to the GitHub releases page for OR-Tools, which contains detailed release notes.\n\nHowever, the search results don't contain specific detailed release notes for OR-Tools versions 9.17 and 9.18 from 2026. The results show references to various versions and CP-SAT improvements across different releases, including HiGHS 1.7.2 integration and experimental set_cover python binding, but not the specific version information you requested.\n\nFor the most up-to-date and detailed release notes for OR-Tools 9.17 and 9.18, I recommend checking:\n- The official OR-Tools GitHub releases page: https://github.com/google/or-tools/releases\n- The Google OR-Tools documentation: https://developers.google.com/optimization/support/release_notes\n\nThese sources should have the specific CP-SAT improvements and changes for those exact versions.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"2034edb5-ee05-4b7a-8aca-2aeb08d1ac05","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:35:26.309Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ce2c409d-875e-4eef-a81d-d78e67ebb813","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"475985ef-c245-499a-af29-9c8d66c58a00","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"64d71192-3b1b-4e70-aef9-d69f40568796","agentId":"a4ecd78d0488484e7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GumDmC1sTu9FtguLpVs7i1","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"OR-Tools 9.16 release CP-SAT changelog 2025\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"OR-Tools Release Notes | Google for Developers\",\"url\":\"https://developers.google.com/optimization/support/release_notes\"},{\"title\":\"Releases · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/releases\"},{\"title\":\"ortools Changelog\",\"url\":\"https://data.safetycli.com/packages/pypi/ortools/changelog\"},{\"title\":\"ortools · PyPI\",\"url\":\"https://pypi.org/project/ortools/\"},{\"title\":\"I’m a bit uncertain about what Google OR-Tools is…it *seems* to be some sort of ... | Hacker News\",\"url\":\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=22582688\"},{\"title\":\"or-tools/ortools/sat/docs/README.md at stable · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/stable/ortools/sat/docs/README.md\"},{\"title\":\"Add official Python 3.14 wheels (Linux/macOS/Windows) for OR-Tools · Issue #4859 · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/issues/4859\"},{\"title\":\"ortools Version: 9.12.4544 not working with gurobi Version: 12.0.1 · Issue #4625 · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/issues/4625\"},{\"title\":\"CP-SAT model that most of the time solved to optimality, but in rare cases it is determined to be infeasible · Issue #4839 · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/issues/4839\"},{\"title\":\"CP-SAT produces nondeterministic results · Issue #3590 · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/issues/3590\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about OR-Tools releases, but I should note that there is no version 9.16 of OR-Tools currently available. According to the PyPI information in the search results, the latest version as of January 2026 is 9.15.6755, released on January 14, 2026.\n\nThe most recent versions available are:\n- 9.15.6755 (Jan 14, 2026)\n- 9.14.6206 (Jun 19, 2025)\n- 9.13.4784 (Jun 6, 2025)\n- 9.12.4544 (Feb 17, 2025)\n\nRegarding CP-SAT changelog information for these recent releases, the 9.11 release included improvements to the no_overlap_2d layer (propagation, presolve, cuts), addition of RandomHalfBranching search heuristics, improvements to Cumulative propagation and cuts, and rewrites to hint transformation during presolve.\n\nIf you're looking for the changelog for a specific version that exists (such as 9.15 or 9.14), I can search for more detailed information. Would you like me to search for the changelog of the latest available version instead?\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"d64d7bee-6b0c-400c-a679-c64c92ea7c18","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:35:27.934Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"475985ef-c245-499a-af29-9c8d66c58a00","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
