{"parentUuid":"271ac0cf-1b6c-4165-9e36-b5a33b8db31c","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"64d71192-3b1b-4e70-aef9-d69f40568796","agentId":"a4ecd78d0488484e7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MBAvWGpUdYvmv6fwKyNiAm","type":"tool_result","content":"# OR-Tools Releases (v9.15 onwards)\n\nBased on the provided content, only **v9.15** is documented as the latest release. Here are the details:\n\n## v9.15\n**Release Date:** January 12, 2026\n\n**CP-SAT Changes:**\n- Enhancements to the `no_overlap_2d` constraint including presolve, propagation, and cuts\n- Detection and utilization of precedences in presolve, propagation, and cuts\n- \"Extensive work on LRAT proof production and checking\"\n- Linear encoding improvements (linear1 and linear2)\n- Experimental support for set variables and constraints\n- Extended enforcement literal support across more constraint types\n- Python layer optimization with improved typing\n- Compatibility improvements for Python 3.14 without the GIL\n- Soft constraint examples added\n- Enhanced shared tree workers with improved clause sharing\n- Solution output on SIGTERM signal\n- Multiple bug fixes and heuristic improvements\n\nNo releases v9.16, v9.17, or v9.18 are present in the documentation provided."}]},"uuid":"661e307b-3c38-4a22-b88b-5ac39c507f93","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:35:40.729Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"271ac0cf-1b6c-4165-9e36-b5a33b8db31c","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
